  "title": "First Potain MDT 489 in Iceland drives new construction thinking on Reykjavik project",
  "summary": "A Potain MDT 489 topless tower crane is leading work on a new residential project in Iceland.The development is being built largely from precast concrete, so the project owner sought the most efficient lifting solution.Local Potain dealer DS Lausnir recommended the Potain MDT 489, which has the strength and reach to cover the whole site from a single location.",
